# Nepho uses Firebase AI Logic (via App Check) for Gemini API access.
# No client-side GEMINI_API_KEY is required or packaged.
# To enable digests, register the Android app in Firebase, add app/google-services.json
# locally, enable Firebase AI Logic with the Gemini Developer API, and configure
# App Check (including a registered debug token for debug builds).
# Digest generation requires network access and a supported Gemini model.
